{"id":875,"name":"Genshiken 2","slug":"genshiken_2","synopsis":"The Society for the Study of Modern Visual Culture, otherwise known as Genshiken, is now under the charge of a more confident Sasahara. Things have changed in between semesters, and the otaku club now has a new otaku-hating member named Ogiue. Sasahara's initial goal of starting a doujin circle and selling those fan-made magazines at the next Comic Festival becomes a reality, but reality is a cruel master... who apparently crossplays. Afterward, the club is abuzz with talk about Tanaka and Ohno's relationship, which takes a hesitant step forward.\n\n(Source: Media Blasters)","format":"TV","season":"FALL","year":2007,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:47","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 02:16:20","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":2508},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":2508},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":2275},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":5210},{"site":"ANN","externalId":7985},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":1513}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":1745,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/dTbXIdbqKANCGmmhpR75E4CABbVqt6hXbwr3p27o.png"},{"id":1746,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/pjL7iYn2DZMnsoltJXjQTVbhpVuPrSzVVge6SiDD.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":170,"name":"Arms","slug":"arms"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":54,"name":"Genshiken","slug":"genshiken"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":2616,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":2616,"title":"disarm dreamer","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":2940,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":1686,"basename":"Genshiken2-OP1.webm","filename":"Genshiken2-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/Genshiken2-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":28193686,"resolution":720,"nc":false,"subbed":false,"lyrics":false,"overlap":"NONE","source":"BD","tags":"BD","audio":{"id":1613,"basename":"Genshiken2-OP1.ogg","filename":"Genshiken2-OP1","link":"https://a.animethemes.moe/Genshiken2-OP1.ogg","m